==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|bye-stander|by-stander||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|en|by|stander}}. Compare ''[[passerby]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈbaɪˌstænd.ə(ɹ)/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-bystander.wav|a=Southern England}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person who, although [[present]] at some [[event]], does not [[take part]] in it; an [[observer]], [[witness]], or [[spectator]].
#: {{syn|en|onlooker}}

====Derived terms====
{{col|en|bystanderish|bystandership|bystander effect|innocent bystander}}

